@HostAddress = http://localhost:5247
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}
@id = 000000000000000000000000

### Cadastro
# @name register
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Joao Silva",
  "email": "joao@email.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@email.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Listar (com filtros opcionais: ?dayOfWeek=Sunday&type=Revisit)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/revisitAndStudies?dayOfWeek=Sunday&type=Revisit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar por id (ObjectId retornado no POST)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/revisitAndStudies/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/revisitAndStudies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria",
  "age": 35,
  "dayOfWeek": "Sunday",
  "details": "Estudo biblico semanal",
  "address": "Rua A, 123",
  "type": "Study"
}

### Atualizar
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/revisitAndStudies/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria",
  "age": 36,
  "dayOfWeek": "Monday",
  "details": "Mudou o dia",
  "address": "Rua A, 123",
  "type": "Revisit"
}

### Deletar
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/revisitAndStudies/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
